    "detailed_description": "KVD has one developer and the gameplay shown above is from a prototype showcasing the direction the flow of combat will go: fast-paced 1v1 ground and air combat with different weapons, skills, and powerups for both players.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501400/extras/8d341064ed24579ccb7caeb756036a18.poster.avif?t=1701107403\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501400/extras/8d341064ed24579ccb7caeb756036a18.webm?t=1701107403\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/501400/extras/8d341064ed24579ccb7caeb756036a18.mp4?t=1701107403\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay</h2><br>A frantic struggle between good and evil springs to life in <i>Knight Versus Demon</i> when a <strong>VR player</strong> takes on the role of a villain going up against the hero: a <strong>local player</strong> using a controller or keyboard / mouse.<br><br><strong>The Villain [VR]</strong><br><br>The villain has a variety of ways to defeat the hero - these include using hands to <strong>slash</strong>, fingers to <strong>impale</strong>, a mouth to <strong>burn</strong>, and eyes to <strong>melt</strong> the shiniest armor any human might equip.<br><br><strong>The Hero [PC]</strong><br><br>The hero uses his speed and light affinity to quickly <strong>dash</strong> through the air delivering blows with his <strong>sword</strong> and volleys from his <strong>bow</strong> while leaving behind <strong>traps</strong> that would cause serious harm to the mightiest of demons.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Content</h2><br>Planned content includes:<br><br>- Multiple stages<br>- A variety of weapons <br>- VR physics-based weapons<br>- Armor<br>- Customizable skills<br>- Special abilities<br>- Powerups",
